ary column operations.\n\nSince adding a multiple of one row (or column) to another row (column) in a matrix does not change the value of its determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -7 & 10 \\\\ -9 & -1 & -6 & 9 \\\\ -2 & 2 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 4 & -7\\end{aligned}| &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{1}:={C}_{1}+{C}_{2} \\\\ {C}_{3}:={C}_{3}+(-1){C}_{2} \\\\ {C}_{4}:={C}_{4}+3{C}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ -10 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the result along the $3$rd row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ -10 & -1 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)^{3+2}|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -5 & 4 \\\\ -10 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 3 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -5 & 4 \\\\ -10 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/state.json" "file_sha256" "8b8c1a36b45ee80b8eae27abfb992b604a32b593eb2ab4e0e1b14d19d24dfd8f"} {"question" "q-91092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9a9c5b9d5c6d4071482066f8a11cb4fd6e5ea09b44a5432efa00d710dabfd4fd"} {"question" "q-91092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/state.json" "file_sha256" "8b8c1a36b45ee80b8eae27abfb992b604a32b593eb2ab4e0e1b14d19d24dfd8f"} {"question" "q-91092" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -