he value of its determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}-6 & 9 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -5 & -3 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 10 & -4 & 5\\end{aligned}| &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{1}:={C}_{1}+2{C}_{4} \\\\ {C}_{2}:={C}_{2}+(-3){C}_{4} \\\\ {C}_{3}:={C}_{3}+{C}_{4}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 6 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 4 & -6 & -3 \\\\ 11 & -5 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the result along the $1$st row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 6 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 4 & -6 & -3 \\\\ 11 & -5 & 1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-1)^{1+4}|\\begin{aligned}4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ -9 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 11 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-3|\\begin{aligned}4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ -9 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 11 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/state.json" "file_sha256" "8b8c1a36b45ee80b8eae27abfb992b604a32b593eb2ab4e0e1b14d19d24dfd8f"} {"question" "q-132024" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9a9c5b9d5c6d4071482066f8a11cb4fd6e5ea09b44a5432efa00d710dabfd4fd"} {"question" "q-132024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058571/state.json" "file_sha256" "8b8c1a36b45ee80b8eae27abfb992b604a32b593eb2ab4e0e1b14d19d24dfd8f"} {"question" "q-132024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 6 \\\\ -9 & 0 & -6 \\\\ 11 & -3 & 10\\end{aligned}|"] ["math" "-3|\\begin{aligned}4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ -9 & 4 & -6 \\\\ 11 & -5 & 1